Work backwards from what reviewers of a {{ kind_name }} require. The kind description and required-evidence checklist are below. Every experiment or activity you propose must name the checklist item it satisfies; do not propose work the paper does not need. Prefer the minimum study that would survive review over an ideal study nobody will finish.

Write Markdown with these headings, in this order:

# Research plan
## The idea in one paragraph
## Research questions
(numbered, each answerable by a specific measurement or observation)
