(step by step; participants or data needed and how to get them; what to measure and with what instrument; how to analyse it; how long it takes for one person)
## Evidence map
(table: checklist item → which activity above satisfies it)
## Threats to validity you will face
## What you should not claim
## Prior work to check before you start
(6 to 10 search keyword phrases for Google Scholar or Semantic Scholar, plus the names of any well-known tools or papers you believe exist, marked "verify")
